sets.setup:
Seven people attended a conference: four ship captains — **L, M, N and O** — and three first assistants — **A, D and G** (so exactly one captain attended without a first assistant). Each person in turn delivered a report, one after another, subject to:

(i) each first assistant delivered their report **immediately after** their own captain;

(ii) the first captain to speak was **M**, and captain **N** spoke at some point after M.

A perfumer blends two or more of five essences — **L, M, N, O and P**. For a blend to be agreeable it must obey every rule below:

(i) any blend with **L** must also contain **N**, with N in **twice** the quantity of L;

(ii) any blend with **M** must also contain **O**, in **equal** proportion;

(iii) **N and O** may not appear in the same blend;

(iv) **O and P** may not be used together;

(v) if **P** is used, the amount of P must be **greater** than the total of all the other essences.
